      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a huge relief, thank you. Actually, just one quick thing—I noticed a tiny spike in the telemetry for the new UI component during the load tests earlier. It looked like memory usage was creeping up slightly, but it probably won't matter for a short demo, right? I just want to be sure that won't cause any lag or crashes while the board is watching.",
